  "description": "The fleet chat turn over HTTP for Webority.Ai.Chat: one call that begins the turn, streams the agent's reply as Server-Sent Events (delta, reset, actions, done, error) with the reply guard applied while it streams, stores the completed exchange, and gives the question back on any failure or disconnect. Early failures answer as an RFC 9457 problem with a fixed code.",
